OL,3,GNEWSAHealth board - situation is
OL,4,A'improving' after critical incident
OL,5,Adeclaration
OL,6,
OL,7,FNHS Grampian says conditions are
OL,8,Fimproving after it declared a critical
OL,9,Fincident over "extreme pressure" on A&E
OL,10,Fservices in two hospitals.
OL,12,FThe incident was declared on Saturday
OL,13,Fafter emergency departments at Aberdeen
OL,14,FRoyal Infirmary and Dr Gray's Hospital
OL,15,Fin Elgin struggled to cope with demand.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,422,420,260,160,0,100
