OL,3,GNEWSAHealth board - situation is
OL,4,A'improving' after critical incident
OL,5,Adeclaration
OL,6,
OL,7,FAn update earlier said no ambulances
OL,8,Fambulances have had to divert to other
OL,9,Fhealth boards, as had been feared. The
OL,10,Fhealth board said colleagues at NHS
OL,11,FTayside remain on standby but both
OL,12,Femergency departments are now better
OL,13,Fplaced to support necessary care.
OL,15,FThe critical incident has not yet been
OL,16,Fstood down.
